fail[3]: 2 nodes: the middle is the second, so the head is all that's left.
fail[4]: One node is the middle, so nothing is left: return None.
fail[5]: 3 nodes: the middle is at index 1.
fail[6]: 10,000 nodes: the middle is the 5001, at index 5000.
